{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://github.com/bodenberg/appdimens-skills/schemas/custom-strategy.schema.json",
  "title": "AppDimens custom scaling strategies",
  "description": "Cross-platform format (version 1) read by every AppDimens custom module: appdimens-dynamic-custom, appdimens-kmp-custom, appdimens-games-custom (+ Unity C#), AppDimensCustom (Apple), appdimens_custom (Flutter), appdimens-react-native/custom, webdimens/custom and AppDimens.Net.Custom. ratio = axis(window) / axis(reference); factor = clamp(curve(ratio) × multiplier × AR, clamp.min, clamp.max); value = formula(valueClamp(base × factor)). A file may hold a document, a single strategy or an array of strategies.",
  "oneOf": [
    {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "strategies"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "$schema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "version": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 1
        },
        "default": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Id used by cdp/csp without an explicit strategy."
        },
        "strategies": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/strategy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/strategy"
    },
    {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/strategy"
      }
    }
  ],
  "$defs": {
    "device": {
      "enum": [
        "phone",
        "tablet",
        "desktop",
        "tv",
        "watch",
        "car",
        "vr"
      ],
      "description": "tablet = normal UI mode with smallest width >= 600."
    },
    "curve": {
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "enum": [
            "linear",
            "power",
            "logarithmic",
            "interpolated",
            "constant"
          ],
          "description": "Shorthand with the default parameter (power 0.75, logarithmic 0.4, interpolated 0.5, constant 1)."
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "type"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "enum": [
                "linear"
              ]
            }
          },
          "description": "factor = r"
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "type"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "enum": [
                "power"
              ]
            },
            "exponent": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "description": "factor = r^exponent (default 0.75)"
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "type"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "enum": [
                "logarithmic"
              ]
            },
            "k": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "description": "factor = 1 + k·ln(r) (default 0.4)"
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "type"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "enum": [
                "interpolated"
              ]
            },
            "t": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "description": "factor = 1 + (r − 1)·t (default 0.5)"
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "type"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "enum": [
                "constant"
              ]
            },
            "factor": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "description": "fixed factor (default 1)"
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "type",
            "points"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "enum": [
                "breakpoints"
              ]
            },
            "points": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 1,
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "at",
                  "factor"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "at": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "minimum": 0
                  },
                  "factor": {
                    "type": "number"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "Piecewise linear over the ABSOLUTE axis value (dp), clamped to the first and last points."
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "type",
            "expression"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "enum": [
                "expression"
              ]
            },
            "expression": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "\\S",
              "description": "Free-form formula; see $defs/expressionLanguage."
            }
          },
          "description": "Free-form factor formula as text. Variables: screen variables + ratio, axis, ref, refWidth, refHeight."
        }
      ]
    },
    "patch": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "reference": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "width": {
              "type": "number",
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0
            },
            "height": {
              "type": "number",
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0
            }
          },
          "description": "Design frame (default 300 × 533)."
        },
        "axis": {
          "enum": [
            "smallestWidth",
            "width",
            "height",
            "min",
            "max",
            "diagonal",
            "perimeter"
          ]
        },
        "curve": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/curve"
        },
        "multiplier": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "clamp": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "min": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "max": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "description": "Bounds for the FACTOR. null (strategy root only) clears inherited bounds."
        },
        "valueClamp": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "min": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "max": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "description": "Bounds for the resulting value's magnitude (0 stays 0). null (root only) clears inherited bounds."
        },
        "aspectRatio": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "enabled": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "sensitivity": {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "description": "× (1 + k·ln(AR / 1.78)); default k = 0.08 / 30."
        },
        "sensitivity": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "fontScale": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "enum": [
                "follow",
                "ignore"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "max"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "max": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "exclusiveMinimum": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "description": "Text (csp) policy: follow the user font scale, ignore it, or follow up to max."
        },
        "ignoreMultiWindow": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Factor 1 in split-screen / freeform windows."
        },
        "formula": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "Free-form per-value formula (variables: curve variables + base, scaled, factor). Makes the strategy value-dependent. null (root only) clears an inherited formula."
        }
      },
      "description": "Fields a rule may set (omitted fields keep their value)."
    },
    "condition": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "device": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/device"
            },
            {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 1,
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/device"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "orientation": {
          "enum": [
            "portrait",
            "landscape"
          ]
        },
        "smallestWidth": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "min": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "max": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "description": "min <= value < max (dp / pt / CSS px)."
        },
        "width": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "min": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "max": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "description": "min <= value < max (dp / pt / CSS px)."
        },
        "height": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "min": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "max": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "description": "min <= value < max (dp / pt / CSS px)."
        },
        "aspectRatio": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "min": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "max": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "description": "max / min side."
        },
        "multiWindow": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      }
    },
    "rule": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "set"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "when": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/condition"
        },
        "set": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/patch"
        }
      },
      "description": "All matching rules apply in declaration order; a later rule overrides the fields an earlier one set."
    },
    "strategy": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*$"
        },
        "extends": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Another strategy of the document, a registered id, a built-in (scaled, power, logarithmic, interpolated, diagonal, perimeter, fixed) or a preset (tabletFriendly, compactFirst, tvSafe, wearable, gameHud, readableText)."
        },
        "reference": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "width": {
              "type": "number",
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0
            },
            "height": {
              "type": "number",
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0
            }
          },
          "description": "Design frame (default 300 × 533)."
        },
        "axis": {
          "enum": [
            "smallestWidth",
            "width",
            "height",
            "min",
            "max",
            "diagonal",
            "perimeter"
          ]
        },
        "curve": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/curve"
        },
        "multiplier": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "clamp": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "min": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "max": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "description": "Bounds for the FACTOR. null (strategy root only) clears inherited bounds."
        },
        "valueClamp": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "min": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "max": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "description": "Bounds for the resulting value's magnitude (0 stays 0). null (root only) clears inherited bounds."
        },
        "aspectRatio": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "enabled": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "sensitivity": {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "description": "× (1 + k·ln(AR / 1.78)); default k = 0.08 / 30."
        },
        "sensitivity": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "fontScale": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "enum": [
                "follow",
                "ignore"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "max"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "max": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "exclusiveMinimum": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "description": "Text (csp) policy: follow the user font scale, ignore it, or follow up to max."
        },
        "ignoreMultiWindow": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Factor 1 in split-screen / freeform windows."
        },
        "formula": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "Free-form per-value formula (variables: curve variables + base, scaled, factor). Makes the strategy value-dependent. null (root only) clears an inherited formula."
        },
        "rules": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/rule"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "expressionLanguage": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Operators: + - * / % ^ (power, right-associative; % keeps the dividend's sign), == != < <= > >=, && || !, cond ? a : b, parentheses. Booleans are numbers (true = 1). Functions: min(a, b, …) max(a, b, …) clamp(x, lo, hi) pow sqrt ln log log10 log2 exp abs sign floor ceil round (half up) lerp(a, b, t) step(edge, x) smoothstep(e0, e1, x). Screen variables: sw width height shortSide longSide diagonal perimeter aspectRatio density fontScale; flags landscape portrait multiWindow phone tablet desktop tv watch car vr; constants pi e. Curve expressions add ratio axis ref refWidth refHeight; formulas add base scaled factor."
    }
  }
}
